  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to relief and reconciliation of conflict-affected communities and increased capacity of civil society in peacebuilding</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The conflict in Northern Ethiopia has had a detrimental effect on the civilian population, with a disproportionate impact on women and girls. Violence in parts of Western Ethiopia is escalating and there is an urgent need to strengthen peacebuilding and dialogue efforts. This measure will increase gender-sensitive relief, recovery and reconciliation activities and improve access of sexual and gender-based violence survivors to justice, legal aid and support services in Northern Ethiopia. It will also strengthen community resilience, conflict prevention and conflict resolution mechanisms in Western Ethiopia. Further, this measure will include support to capacity building, networking and resourcing of local peacebuilding civil society organisations.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;</narrative>
  </description>
